  ],
  "what": [
   {
    "text": "SlowMist 称 UNCX Vesting V2 合约存在份额记账逻辑漏洞,即 VestingManager.cancel 未确保保留的份额足以覆盖已释放的数额。",
    "cite": [
     "it_6a481cdbb0f4cd48"
    ],
    "grounded": true,
    "issues": []
   },
   {
    "text": "攻击者先直接转入代币以降低每代币份额比率,然后释放并取消归属计划,从共享归属池中抽走超额代币。",
    "cite": [
     "it_6a481cdbb0f4cd48"
    ],
    "grounded": true,
    "issues": []
   },
   {
    "text": "DeFiLlama 将该事件归类为 UNCX Network V2 的代币与份额记账错误(Incorrect Share Accounting)。",
    "cite": [
     "it_f71f320a30ff77fd"
    ],
    "grounded": true,
    "issues": []
   }
  ],
  "impact": [
   {
    "text": "受影响的链包括 Ethereum、Base、BSC 和 Robinhood Chain。",
    "cite": [
     "it_f71f320a30ff77fd"
    ],
    "grounded": true,
    "issues": []
   },
   {
    "text": "以太坊上的初始损失约为8.6万美元,后来升至跨多链约149万美元。",
    "cite": [
     "it_6a481cdbb0f4cd48"
    ],
    "grounded": false,
    "issues": [
     "ungrounded_number"
    ]
   }
  ],
  "exploitation": [
